<title>UK: FKI firms on trading update, SocGen rating.</title>
<headline>FKI firms on trading update, SocGen rating.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in FKI Plc firmed on Friday after the UK engineering concern said it was confident about its annual results despite the strength of sterling.</p>
<p>The shares got an additional boost after SogGen analyst Andy Chambers repeated his &quot;buy&quot; recommendation.</p>
<p>The shares were marked up 4p to 187-1/2p by 1030 GMT.</p>
</text>
